                                        "entry_id": "b15ac8d1-4da4-3a47-a0a9-e013c0030a20",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A deal in a card game, écarté, that draws all the tricks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5512f4e4-f2db-48b9-8ff9-6f15a2213aff",
                                                "sense_id": "b39896e2-180f-3ffe-9e15-79a2644307d0",
                                                "text": "Ladies, I'll venture for the vole."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1256f91-493d-4a5c-a6ed-9c57e48aa7ec",
                                                "sense_id": "b39896e2-180f-3ffe-9e15-79a2644307d0",
                                                "text": "With humble curate can I now retire,\n(While good Sir Peter boozes with the squire,)\nAnd at backgammon mortify my soul,\nThat pants for loo, or flutters at a vole?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
